{"id":"n41565-1-8","stage":5,"title":"꺼림칙하다 · 不安","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41565-1-8-1","ko":"우리가 승규를 도와줬어야 했나?","zh":"我们当时应该去帮承奎的吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"승규를","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"승규를","audio":"/audio/3389fc880f16d010277c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규를","audio":"/audio/3389fc880f16d010277c.mp3"}},{"text":"도와줬어야","meaning":"帮忙，帮助","explanation":"도와주다：帮忙，帮助；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"도와주다","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70744","senseId":"1","lemma":"도와주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와줬어야","audio":"/audio/858db5f09719a5e7e78b.mp3"}},{"text":"했나?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했나","audio":"/audio/19183aa84a54a8200246.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"1505f995680e9a46","term":"도와주다","zh":"帮忙，帮助","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3","entryId":"70744","definition":"帮别人做事或助人一臂之力。","pronunciation":["도와주다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/91d0be40c6ffee472d6d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41565-1-8-2","ko":"그러게 말야. 나도 도와주지 못한 게 계속 걸려서 꺼림칙했어.","zh":"就是啊。我也因为没能帮忙而一直耿耿于怀，心里很不是滋味。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"말야.","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말야","audio":"/audio/ad8c9ec9f36331d71376.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"도와주지","meaning":"帮，帮助；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와주지","audio":"/audio/3d15d0677278b1b44917.mp3"}},{"text":"못한","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못한","audio":"/audio/ef515538c3621ef7d6ed.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려서","meaning":"卡，噎，挂","explanation":"걸리다：卡，噎，挂；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"9","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려서","audio":"/audio/78c87e4c8b27674bc627.mp3"}},{"text":"꺼림칙했어.","meaning":"不安，歉疚，不舒坦","explanation":"꺼림칙하다：不安，歉疚，不舒坦；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"꺼림칙하다","audio":"/audio/d54fd506061018b19496.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41565","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼림칙하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꺼림칙했어","audio":"/audio/47553e95410937519ebf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"卡，噎，挂","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"看上去或心里等不满意，心情不好。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"d54fd506061018b1","term":"꺼림칙하다","zh":"不安，歉疚，不舒坦","audio":"/audio/d54fd506061018b19496.mp3","entryId":"41565","definition":"因无法释怀而感到不悦或厌烦。","pronunciation":["꺼림치카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/493a6a06fb3545d2be33.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.477,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41565","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.3037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们当时应该去帮承奎的吧？","就是啊。我也因为没能帮忙而一直耿耿于怀，心里很不是滋味。","发生什么事了吗？大家都在尖叫着跑过去呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们当时应该去帮承奎的吧？","就是啊。我也因为没能帮忙而一直耿耿于怀，心里很不是滋味。","发生什么事了吗？大家都在尖叫着跑过去呢。"],"answer":1}]}
